,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.128672473,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.129573994,"data":"RENDER VERSUS RENDER, equal batch, same card, same run, same world, max_steps 32, uint8 out\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.130475896,"data":"  ref render / ref step are cudaEvent medians in MICROSECONDS.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.131399797,"data":"  tg is the sum of per-kernel device times for the whole generated graph.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.132133865,"data":"  Every row is render against render: the same computation, the same\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.13294617,"data":"  output, the same dtype, the same card. Nothing here divides a per-step\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.133837363,"data":"  number by a per-op number.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.134791887,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.13571182,"data":"    batch  ref render us   ref step us   naive ms    lean ms  naive/ref  lean/ref    kernels n/l\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.13658663,"data":"      256           88.1         129.0     13.698       16.0       6.43      5.51          41/38\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.138148737,"data":"      512          166.5         208.9     13.648     15.958      12.20     10.43          41/38\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.138425261,"data":"     1024          323.6         369.1      8.811      2.923      36.73    110.71           10/6\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.139326299,"data":"     2048          598.6         646.1     17.192       5.54      34.82    108.05           11/6\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.14019877,"data":"     4096         1185.8        1237.5          -          -          -         -      None/None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.141067927,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.141985165,"data":"MEMORY, the allocator's own peak\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.142884469,"data":"  batch    256 naive    peak     133.8 MiB  allocs 26\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.143765288,"data":"  batch    256 lean     peak     129.0 MiB  allocs 1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.144653883,"data":"  batch    512 naive    peak     143.6 MiB  allocs 11\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.145464882,"data":"  batch    512 lean     peak     130.0 MiB  allocs 1\n"}
