,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.149746273,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.150652865,"data":"THE DDA WORKLOAD EACH TIMING ACTUALLY DID\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.151611418,"data":"  batch   2048 naive    mean 16.540  at the 32 cap  41.9%  first voxel  0.0%  gate PASS\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.15260746,"data":"  batch   2048 lean     mean 16.540  at the 32 cap  41.9%  first voxel  0.0%  gate PASS\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.153588352,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.154512363,"data":"IDENTITY, on the state the reference itself produced\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.155463507,"data":"  naive                 0 /   4194304 pixels differ   BYTE-IDENTICAL\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.15623269,"data":"  naive                 0 /   4194304 pixels differ   BYTE-IDENTICAL\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.157146651,"data":"  lean                  0 /   4194304 pixels differ   BYTE-IDENTICAL\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.158085118,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.159021297,"data":"THE TWO RATIOS, AND WHAT EACH IS\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.160029753,"data":"  batch   256: naive   6.43x, lean   5.51x, and the optimization removes  14.4% of the generated side's time\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.160906917,"data":"  batch   512: naive  12.20x, lean  10.43x, and the optimization removes  14.5% of the generated side's time\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.16181817,"data":"  batch  1024: naive  36.73x, lean 110.71x, and the optimization removes -201.4% of the generated side's time\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.162740851,"data":"  batch  2048: naive  34.82x, lean 108.05x, and the optimization removes -210.3% of the generated side's time\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.163614656,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.164439743,"data":"  The naive column is the port that recomputes the flat voxel\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.165420813,"data":"  address from three float coordinates on every one of 32 steps.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.166365277,"data":"  The lean column is the same computation with that arithmetic\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.167267043,"data":"  hoisted into a maintained address and precomputed strides, and\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.168276033,"data":"  with the per-axis bounds test computed once per ray. Both are\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.169125073,"data":"  plain TinyGrad: no custom_kernel, no tile size, no Context, no\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.170070065,"data":"  hand-unrolling, no codegen knob.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.170895066,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.171817565,"data":"WHAT TO READ\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.172598498,"data":"  * Both ports render the observation the hand-written kernel produced,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.173543856,"data":"    on the state the hand-written kernel produced, byte for byte, on this\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.174314904,"data":"    card in this run. That is what makes the ratio a statement about code\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.175030799,"data":"    generation rather than about two different computations.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.176049625,"data":"  * `naive` is minecu_tg/render.py verbatim; `lean` is the same\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.176729752,"data":"    computation with the index arithmetic hoisted. The difference between\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.177424864,"data":"    the two columns is the port's cost, not the compiler's.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.178052982,"data":"  * No number here is transcribed from any notes file. Every figure is\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.178769077,"data":"    produced by an instrument in this notebook on this card.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.179500793,"data":"  * Instruction and register counts are NOT taken from this notebook:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.180158694,"data":"    they are a property of a compiler version, this image is CUDA 12.8,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.180828964,"data":"    and the offline sm_75 route is 12.9 on BOTH sides.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.181620423,"data":"    minecu_tg_opt/opcount.py is where the SASS numbers come from, and it\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.182258757,"data":"    re-derives the hand-written side's own 776 and its 38-instruction step\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1584.182902063,"data":"    from minecu_ref/build/kernels_sm_75.sass rather than quoting them.\n"}
